      "type": "question",
      "label": "15",
      "prompt": "In a class of 30 students, 18 play soccer, 12 play basketball, and 7 play both sports.\nHow many students play soccer or basketball?",
      "answerSpaceMm": 18,
      "answer": {
        "short": "23 students.",
        "worked": "Let $S$ and $B$ be the sets of students who play soccer and basketball.\n$$\\begin{align*}|S\\cup B|&=|S|+|B|-|S\\cap B|\\\\|S\\cup B|&=18+12-7\\\\|S\\cup B|&=23\\end{align*}$$\n23 students play soccer or basketball.",
